      <slug></slug>
      <title>Prism</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>Mozilla</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;As Prism approaches its 1.0 release, we will discuss the current state of the project and future plans.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;We will look at a demo of how web applications can deploy desktop integration features using Prism, including tray icons, dock/tray menus, protocol handlers, sound and bubble notifications.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Future plans that will be covered include Greasemonkey support, icon/user script repository, user interface improvements and tighter integration with Firefox.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </description>
      <persons>
          <person id="1951">Matthew Gertner</person>
      </persons>
      <links></links>
      <video></video>
      <end></end>
  </event>